  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Thinly slice celery.\n• Grate carrot.\n• In a medium bowl, combine carrot and mixed salad leaves. Set aside. Little cooks: Older kids, help grate the carrot under adult supervision.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb5366329c8e5b722b3ae/step-879e6900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cook fusilli in the boiling water until ‘al dente’, 11 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl.\n• When pasta is ready, reserve some pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people / 2/3 cup for 4 people), then drain pasta and return to saucepan. TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb5366329c8e5b722b3ae/step-24abd410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook celery, tossing, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then add light cooking cream and garlic & herb seasoning. Return veggie mince to pan, then cook, stirring, until sauce is slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat. Stir in the butter, basil pesto and cooked fusilli until combined and butter is melted (if needed, add a dash of reserved pasta water to loosen the sauce). Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb5366329c8e5b722b3ae/step-2af8f720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Dress salad with balsamic vinaigrette dressing, tossing to coat.\n• Divide swift plant-based mince pesto fusilli between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.\n• Serve with side salad. Enjoy! Little cooks: Add the finishing touch by sprinkling the Parmesan cheese on top.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb5366329c8e5b722b3ae/step-f8f46330.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
